  "prefLabel": "Site 102.38 Public information hearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Site 102.38 “Public information hearing” means a hearing scheduled pursuant to RSA 162-H:10, I-c where the applicant presents information to the committee and other agencies that have permitting or other regulatory authority over the subject matter and to the public about the proposed facility.\n\nSource. #10993, eff 12-16-15 (from Site 102.17)",
